<title>USA: Statewide cleared to buy more shares.</title>
<headline>Statewide cleared to buy more shares.</headline>
<dateline>JERSEY CITY, N.J. 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statewide Financial Corp on Monday said it received the necessary waiver from the Office of Thrift Supervision to conduct the second part of its previously announced 10 percent stock repurchase program.</p>
<p>Under the program, the company has already repurchased five percent of its outstanding stock and will now be able to repurchase an additional five percent.</p>
<p>As of the end of the first quarter, the company had about 4.3 million shares outstanding.</p>
